<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <!-- Merged into the app's Info.plist by Tauri. App Transport Security blocks plain http to dotted host
       names (Tailscale MagicDNS names, nip.io) in WKWebView; another computer's easy-study server is often
       reached exactly like that (DESIGN §19). IP addresses and .local names work without it. -->
  <key>NSAppTransportSecurity</key>
  <dict>
    <key>NSAllowsArbitraryLoadsInWebContent</key>
    <true/>
  </dict>
  <!-- macOS 15+: shown when the app first connects to another computer on this network. -->
  <key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key>
  <string>다른 컴퓨터에서 실행 중인 easy-study 서버에 연결하려면 로컬 네트워크에 접근해야 해요.</string>
  <!-- Lecture recordings (DESIGN §22): shown when the recorder first asks for the microphone. Without this key
       WKWebView has no navigator.mediaDevices at all (rec-live spike). The app also needs the entitlement
       com.apple.security.device.audio-input (app.entitlements): it runs with the hardened runtime. -->
  <key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
  <string>강의를 녹음해 이 컴퓨터에서 바로 받아쓰려면 마이크가 필요해요. 녹음은 이 컴퓨터의 라이브러리에만 저장돼요. (easy-study records the lecture with the microphone and transcribes it on this computer; the recording stays in your library.)</string>
</dict>
</plist>
